{"type":"text","timestamp":1788215963353,"sessionID":"ses_fa606ac90ffe98xXrlhK72YTFi","part":{"id":"prt_059fa2a4b001ZYpgMRM5v98rYk","messageID":"msg_059f9fe4b001vcspymc8h8Bfmr","sessionID":"ses_fa606ac90ffe98xXrlhK72YTFi","type":"text","text":"I’ve got the fix shape: switch to the stdlib `csv` reader/writer, make `--where` repeatable with validation, validate field references centrally, and sort via `-field` with numeric-aware keys. I’m patching that now, then I’ll add regression tests for repeated filters and error handling.","time":{"start":1788215962187,"end":1788215963351},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0c27328190a8084d016a96029a15ac87d2852cb40676b53579","phase":"commentary"}}}}
